  "_notes": {
    "pal-drafted-units": "18 pre-existing units set to Draft 2026-08-26 (no teacher-level Archive exists in this deployment; Draft hides from students/parents and the unit calendar, reversible). Planners harvested to raw/ first.",
    "pal-lb-deleted": "17 weekly sketchbook Learning Behaviour tasks deleted 2026-08-29. Doğan runs Learning Behaviour himself; managebac.mjs no longer generates LB for any course.",
    "pal-rewrite": "All 13 PAL assignments retitled and rewritten 2026-08-29 for ESL readability in Doğan’s voice, each with objectives, description, guidelines and rubric. Source of truth is the vault; the 7 Course Skills items gained their own pages.",
    "a-level-drafted-units": "12 pre-existing units set to Draft 2026-08-29 (the retired C1-critique scheme and C3 units); planners harvested to raw/ first.",
    "art-app-drafted-units": "13 pre-existing units set to Draft 2026-08-29 (an earlier full-year sketch of this course); planners harvested to raw/ first.",
    "art-app-hs-category-label": "ManageBac's own label in this class is 'FInal Exam' (capital I), a typo on their side. Tasks are set by category id, so the mapping is correct regardless.",
    "2026-08-29": "Lessons loaded as first-class objects (81 across five classes) and every unit description replaced with the unit overview plus its lesson list. Lesson and unit URLs are not recorded per object: they are reachable from the class units index, and the loader addresses lessons by their L-code within a unit.",
    "2026-08-29-verify": "Full sync check against the platform: every lesson and unit body read back and compared to a normalized-text fingerprint of the courses-site build. 10 lessons and 1 unit were re-pushed to match; 3 Art Appreciation task titles were fixed in the vault instead, because the drift was an em dash the house style bars.",
    "2026-08-29-stream": "27 class-stream materials posts loaded, 84 of 85 files. ManageBac caps a post at 10 files, so Art Appreciation U3 splits into materials (4 decks) and readings (9 PDFs) in both sections; the generator now emits that split. ManageBac cannot schedule a post: Date Added stamps it with the unit start date but every post is visible immediately.",
    "2026-08-29-ap-fix": "AP correction complete in DD26AAP13: all ten tasks retitled to the AP scheme, A1 and A4 moved to Others (Major), five briefs repasted. The same five briefs and L15 were also stale in the A-Level class AL26AAP34, and Media had drifted separately from the 13:36 auto-sync. All corrected. The nine Learning Behaviour postings are Dogan's to create: emitLB false keeps them out of the pack while includeLB true keeps them in the numbering, so the AP Minors band stays in date order and both Art Appreciation classes carry the same ten assignments of mine."
  }
